633 |   -> authenticating
634 |   -> login_otp | authenticated
635 | 
636 | signed_out
637 |   -> reset_requested
638 |   -> reset_otp
639 |   -> authenticated
640 | 
641 | authenticated
642 |   -> refreshing
643 |   -> authenticated | signed_out
644 | ```
